.nh
.TH "PB-TEAM-DECLINE" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-team-decline - Decline an invitation bound to this account


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb team decline <invitation> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Decline an invitation addressed to this account, so you do not join the team. The invitation
ID comes from pb team invitations. Invitations addressed to other accounts cannot be declined.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for decline

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print canonical JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb team invitations
  pb team decline inv_abc123
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-team(1)\fP
